      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机会难得，\n我请㭴本训练员让我观摩小小蚕茧的训练后，\n与她一起前往训练的场所。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf08fddae839ae75877c70a6b2e7d124219ee107382e5d7233605db9e0457510",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
